# Rhenium · Re · gate 75

**Rhenium** (Re) is element **75** of the periodic table — a **transition metal**, period 6, group 7, d-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **186.21**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
One of the rarest metals; the superalloy that lets a jet turbine take the heat.

## The gate (silicon layer — the 118 Gates)
Under David Wise's four-state cycle, gate **75** falls on **0:0 = 1 = 0** because (Z−1) mod 4 = **2**. That state is *the collapse where nothing equals one equals nothing — the return to the single source* — the nature of emergence here is **spiritual**. Rhenium is not a thing apart; it is the one stochastic element, caught at this beat of its cycle.

## Emergence — spiritual
This emergent carries the **spiritual** nature: the same four — natural · ethereal · spiritual · electrical — that run through every sphere of UD0. Its color is `#e6a849`.

